{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11221190","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11221190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1122119001:1":{"text":"哈，像银喙这种自私自利的混蛋，居然还能招到小弟？你们是不是太笨了，连他的当也上。","source_cn":"哈，像银喙这种自私自利的混蛋，居然还能招到小弟？你们是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17C2CC1BD38B5C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122119002:1":{"text":"你……你才笨！我告诉你，我老憨可是最精明的！","source_cn":"你……你才笨！我告诉你，我老憨可是最精明的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BBA45F92C118F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122119003:1":{"text":"就你这种货色，怎么当上赏金猎人的？别是银喙把你坑来的吧。","source_cn":"就你这种货色，怎么当上赏金猎人的？别是银喙把你坑来的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6112D59796803401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122119004:1":{"text":"他过去可是做了不少烂事，背叛同伴、出卖情报、侵吞财宝……这样的人，你们跟着他有什么好处？","source_cn":"他过去可是做了不少烂事，背叛同伴、出卖情报、侵吞财宝…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9303FD336DCE65C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122119005:1":{"text":"胡扯！我和银喙搭档的时间也不短了，从来没见他做过这种事！","source_cn":"胡扯！我和银喙搭档的时间也不短了，从来没见他做过这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE62C5A03CA2FCEED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122119006:1":{"text":"庆幸吧，你的利用价值还不够，不然早就被他丢去喂钢颚兽了。","source_cn":"庆幸吧，你的利用价值还不够，不然早就被他丢去喂钢颚兽了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4030E51164C10072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1122119007:1":{"text":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","source_cn":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5CCA5ECCF3C1548","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","female":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","variant_male_record_index":"126679","variant_female_record_index":"126680","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1122119007":{"text":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","source_cn":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5CCA5ECCF3C1548","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","female":"主人……这个人说话好欠打啊！！满满要忍不住了！！","variant_male_record_index":"126679","variant_female_record_index":"126680","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122119008:1":{"text":"哈，没想到，这还有个明事理的家伙嘛。","source_cn":"哈，没想到，这还有个明事理的家伙嘛。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB99D731A48DBA3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"哈，没想到，这还有个明事理的家伙嘛。","female":"哈，没想到，这还有个明事理的家伙嘛。","variant_male_record_index":"126681","variant_female_record_index":"126682","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122119009:1":{"text":"那就让我来聊聊他过去的龌龊事吧……","source_cn":"那就让我来聊聊他过去的龌龊事吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B836D7C439A9A58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1122119010:3":{"text":"——等等！","source_cn":"——等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57CD0DECFD59D53A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1122119011:1":{"text":"哟，终于出现了。我差点以为你害怕得带着包袱逃跑了呢。","source_cn":"哟，终于出现了。我差点以为你害怕得带着包袱逃跑了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7ACB7CD068B5A05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1122119012:1":{"text":"艾伯特，你又来闹事干什么！要钱？还是想让我再揍你一顿？","source_cn":"艾伯特，你又来闹事干什么！要钱？还是想让我再揍你一顿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A3B6424821484DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1122119013:1":{"text":"上门讨债这么平常的事，别说得那么功利，我的好兄弟。","source_cn":"上门讨债这么平常的事，别说得那么功利，我的好兄弟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F78843ACA1CA2DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1122119014:1":{"text":"也别忘了，当初你是怎么拿到悬赏分成的。","source_cn":"也别忘了，当初你是怎么拿到悬赏分成的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EE095A3E0EF041F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1122119015:1":{"text":"……钱，可以给你。但你拿了就滚，少来我的地盘撒野！","source_cn":"……钱，可以给你。但你拿了就滚，少来我的地盘撒野！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ABBA42527D681A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1122119016:1":{"text":"记住——这是你欠我的。","source_cn":"记住——这是你欠我的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADD42862B50B8B5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1122119017:1":{"text":"艾伯特拿着银喙丢出的钱袋，大摇大摆地离开了……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D75C97DD627B038","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1122119018:1":{"text":"银喙！你为什么要给那个混蛋钱？！他刚才明明就是在污蔑你！","source_cn":"银喙！你为什么要给那个混蛋钱？！他刚才明明就是在污蔑你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7214E92C0A3BFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1122119019:1":{"text":"我和他之间的恩怨，不关你的事，你少管。","source_cn":"我和他之间的恩怨，不关你的事，你少管。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD52CAF982CF9946F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1122119020:1":{"text"