","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE80E95044D54FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1122119024:1":{"text":"这是权宜之计！\n只有尽快建设基地，才会有更多赏金猎人加入我们。","source_cn":"这是权宜之计！\\n只有尽快建设基地，才会有更多赏金猎人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2734222BF08DAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1122119025:1":{"text":"到时候，我们才能接更大的委托，赚取更多酬金。","source_cn":"到时候，我们才能接更大的委托，赚取更多酬金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59F598D65D79E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:34:1122119025":{"text":"到时候，我们才能接更大的委托，赚取更多酬金。","source_cn":"到时候，我们才能接更大的委托，赚取更多酬金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59F598D65D79E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1122119027:1":{"text":"赏金猎人大多习惯独自行动，虽然来去潇洒，可一旦遇到困难，往往没处求援，只能干瞪眼。我是不想再冒这么大的风险了。","source_cn":"赏金猎人大多习惯独自行动，虽然来去潇洒，可一旦遇到困难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5F319864FB2CF6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1122119028:1":{"text":"等我们的基地建设起来，也许就能改变现状，让赏金猎人也变成一个强大的组织。","source_cn":"等我们的基地建设起来，也许就能改变现状，让赏金猎人也变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87C